[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8102.87, "timestamp": "02:15:02", "text": "比如里面的东西。哦，就是炖菜。我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8107.27, "timestamp": "02:15:07", "text": "嗯，我的意思是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8110.47, "timestamp": "02:15:10", "text": "我嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.79, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "只要能吃就没问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8133.669, "timestamp": "02:15:33", "text": "好吧，难道我不需要把你绑架过来吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8136.95, "timestamp": "02:15:36", "text": "我需要，我需要让你吃什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8140.069, "timestamp": "02:15:40", "text": "其实是很好的食物。你需要 你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8143.27, "timestamp": "02:15:43", "text": "味道。你需要的不仅仅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.79, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8150.55, "timestamp": "02:15:50", "text": "你知道，如果里面什么都没有的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8154.31, "timestamp": "02:15:54", "text": "现在这房子，嗯，是的，但它就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8157.99, "timestamp": "02:15:57", "text": "不是吗？不只是吗？这不是关于……"}]